## Build generated
build/
DerivedData/
# RareImagery.xcodeproj IS committed (xcodegen-generated) so Xcode Cloud can
# resolve the project + shared scheme from the git tree — ci_post_clone.sh
# regenerates it on CI, but plan-time validation reads git. project.yml stays
# the source of truth: regenerate with `xcodegen generate` and commit the diff,
# never hand-edit the pbxproj. Only per-user cruft below is ignored.
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

